Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:20:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] RPi5: kodi: the stereoscopic 3D series on Kodi 22.0rc2

LibreELEC.tv builds Kodi 22.0rc2-Piers from 01a57f984b on. Of the
series, 0017, 0022 and 0023 are refreshed for it, and 0021 (keep a
Blu-ray menu out of the subtitles' way) goes: Kodi now keeps Blu-ray
menu overlays apart from subtitles and across flushes itself. 0023
loses the lines that cleared the menu overlays by 0021's source, which
opening an input stream now does. The other patches apply as they are.

Signed-off-by: Bryan Hoban <bryan.hoban@gmail.com>
---
